    "title": "Free Line Dancing and Live Music in Downtown Pawhuska",
    "text": "21 hours ago Free line dancing and live music will take place in downtown Pawhuska on Saturday, October 10 on the street on the north side of the Triangle Building / Frontier Hotel . Line dancing, sponsored by Liberty Ranch , starts at 1:00 PM , and live music with Steve Liddell , sponsored by The Pawhuska Hospital and Cohesive Healthcare Management , starts at 5:30 PM as part of the Tallgrass Retreat weekend, and everyone is welcome to attend.\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Pawhuska Chamber of Commerce\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
